5323480315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532348/5323480314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_671_SUBEX_2012_2013_19072013171316.zip","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532348/5323480313.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Subex reported a 7.7% QoQ and 24% YoY revenue growth for Q2 FY27, marking five consecutive quarters of QoQ growth alongside an EBITDA margin of 20.8% and PAT at 16.7%. Management emphasized positioning the company toward the intersection of intelligence, decisions, and economic integrity, leveraging AI agents and domain expertise. The company reported cash and cash equivalents of INR 198 crores and highlighted appreciation in minority investments in PrivaSapien and OnGrid. Discussions during the call addressed product modernization, deployment timelines, and the strategic focus on sustainable growth and inorganic opportunities. Subex Limited reported its Q2 FY27 financial results, highlighting a 7.7% QoQ and 24.2% YoY increase in revenue to ₹8,559 lakhs.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management stated a directional aspiration for high single digit to double digit growth.","quote":"Where we are going we definitely want to you know -- aspiration is obviously to do, I would say that a high single digit, double digit.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that the Middle East market goes hot and cold and creates some impact.","quote":"The challenges are not any different from what I think everyone knows, which is Middle East. Middle East seems to be going hot and cold.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that almost all RFPs are asking for AI use cases.","quote":"• Almost all RFPs ask for AI use cases","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"Fraud Management was highlighted as a top AI and GenAI use case amongst telcos.","quote":"• Fraud Management a top AI & GenAI Use Case amongst Telcos","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that they are seeing a slowdown and cautious buying with extended timelines from the Middle East and the Asia Pacific region.","quote":"Where we are seeing caution is obviously from the Middle East, and we are seeing some cautious buying on, I would say, little extended timelines even from Asia Pacific.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that Africa is generally a slower market and is currently slowing down further.","quote":"Africa has generally been slow. It's slowing down.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA margin stood at 20.8% and PAT fell at 16.7% for the quarter.","quote":"Our EBITDA margin stood at 20.8%, while PAT falls at 16.7%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA and PBT grew QoQ despite the annual wage increase in Q2.","quote":"EBITDA and PBT grew QoQ, even with annual wage increase in Q2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"The company does not capitalize R&D expenses, running them entirely through the P&L.","quote":"Our R&D is not capitalized. It's a P&L. So all our R&D expenses go through the P&L.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"Normalized EBITDA margin stood at 20.8% in Q2FY27, marking a 40 bps decline on a QoQ basis.","quote":"• Normalized EBITDA margin stood at 20.8% in Q2FY27 as compared to 21.2% in Q1FY27, a decline of 40bps on QoQ basis.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"Normalized PAT percentage stood at 16.7% in Q2 FY27.","quote":"• Normalised PAT % stood at 16.7% in Q2 FY27 vs 20.3% in Q1 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Subex secured a new Partner Ecosystem Management deal with an APAC operator.","quote":"• Secured a new Partner Ecosystem Management deal with an APAC operator","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"The company won a new group account in Africa for deploying Fraud Management at 2 opcos.","quote":"• Won a new group account in Africa for deploying Fraud Management at 2 opcos","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"Subex received a Phase 2 PEM order from a Tier 1 operator in the Middle East.","quote":"• Received a Phase 2 PEM order from a Tier 1 operator in the Middle East","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"The company secured a new customer in Europe for Partner Ecosystem Management.","quote":"• Secured a new customer in Europe for Partner Ecosystem Management","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Cash and cash equivalents stood at INR 198 crores at the end of the quarter.","quote":"Cash and cash equivalents stood at now INR 198 crores as of quarter end, as against INR 184 crores at the end of previous quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"The company cannot execute a buyback currently due to negative retained earnings.","quote":"In terms of buybacks, we can't do a buyback right now, because I think all of you on the call are aware that we have negative retained earnings.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"Minority investments in PrivaSapien and OnGrid appreciated approximately 5x and 2x respectively relative to original investment values.","quote":"Based on the latest valuations available to us, these investments have appreciated approximately 5x and 2x respectively relative to their original investment values.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"The company ended the quarter with cash and cash equivalents of INR 184.8 crores.","quote":"We also ended the quarter with cash and cash equivalents of INR 184.8 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Geopolitical issues in the Middle East and US elections were noted as uncertainties and potential impacts.","quote":"Middle East is one impact, and of course, US and elections are always, I don't know, a wildcard.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the war in the Middle East has caused caution and led to a one- or two-month drag on contract closures.","quote":"There has been a month forward. It shifted by a month. We are seeing some shifts like this. That had just what happens is that the war in the Middle East, but the fact of the matter is everyone gets cautious around it.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The management plans to publish a plan and continue investor meeting momentum following the results.","quote":"So we definitely plan to continue this, and we are working with UI, actually, on a plan. So maybe we'll publish a plan you know, and to the investors, so that you know which are the cities that we are coming to or the dates and all that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company intends to execute the ESOP trust share purchase from the market, spacing it out over time when there is no UPSI.","quote":"We may not do it in one go. We'll space it out a little bit, but we will be doing it. Typically when trust is buying shares, I think the only constraint that we have is that we have to do the buyback only when there is no UPSI on hand.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6148572e-6075-402d-ba22-98b708bc3505.pdf","timeframe":"Q3"},{"claim":"Management committed that the company will squarely focus on growth for FY27.","quote":"FY27, we are going to be squarely focused on growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management stated the goal to bring implementation timelines down by a quarter.","quote":"A quarter, I feel that if we are able to crash from five quarters to four quarters or in projects where we are doing in four quarters to three quarters, that will give us enormous leverage in terms of revenues.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":25,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":6,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}